/Title (The analysis shows that revenue is dominated by beverage categories, with Coffee and Tea significantly outperforming all other products across every store location. Coffee emerges as the primary revenue driver, followed closely by Tea, indicating strong customer demand for core beverages. Mid-performing categories such as Bakery and Drinking Chocolate contribute moderately, while products like Flavours, Packaged Chocolate, and Branded items generate minimal revenue. The consistent pattern across all locations suggests stable customer preferences, with slight variations highlighting opportunities for targeted product strategies)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 661 0 R
/Next 711 0 R
>>
